# Product Vision — Nice Price Bazar

This project is a professional e-commerce, wholesale, and delivery platform for Nice Price Bazar.

The product is NOT a generic Amazon clone.
The product is NOT a random AI-generated shopping app.
The product must feel connected to the real physical shop: affordable, colorful, useful, practical, local, and friendly.

## Core product goals

- Customers can browse products as guests.
- Customers can register and order products.
- Wholesale/company customers can see special prices when approved.
- Delivery agents can manage assigned deliveries.
- Admins manage products, users, companies, orders, and delivery operations from the admin dashboard.
- The app should later become geo-specialized with maps, address picking, delivery zones, live delivery tracking, and route UX.

## User roles

- Guest
- Normal customer
- Wholesale/company customer
- Delivery agent
- Platform admin

## Product personality

The app should feel:
- trustworthy
- fast
- practical
- warm
- clear
- premium enough for iOS
- recognizable as Nice Price Bazar

The app should NOT feel:
- generic
- copied from Amazon
- overloaded with red/yellow
- childish
- AI-generated
- fake or full of non-working features

## Important rule

Never add fake UI for features that are not implemented.
If a feature needs backend/API support, create a TODO and explain the required backend work.